&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Given:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;A and B can complete a work in 12 days and 20 days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concept used:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Total work = LCM of the time taken by the workers&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;LCM of 12 and 20 is 60&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, efficiency of A = 60/12 = 5&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;and b = 60/20 = 3&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, effective efficiency = 5&amp;nbsp;+ 3&amp;nbsp;= 8&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In 4 days they will complete 8&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 4 = 32 units&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Remaining = 60 - 32&amp;nbsp;= 28 units&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, efficiency of C = 28/14 = 2&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, B and C will take = 60/(3 +2) = 12 days&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;there4;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;B and C together can complete the same work in 12 days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Shortcut Trick&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/02/F1_Arun%20K_%20Shraddha_17.02.2022_D3.png&quot; style=&quot;width: 164px; height: 122px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;So, effective efficiency = 5&amp;nbsp;+ 3&amp;nbsp;= 8&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;In 4 days they will complete 8&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 4 = 32 units&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Remaining = 60 - 32&amp;nbsp;= 28 units&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;So, efficiency of C = 28/14 = 2&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;So, B and C will take = 60/(3 +2) = 12 days&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;&amp;there4;&amp;nbsp;B and C together can complete the same work in 12 days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

